sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant PostService
    participant PostRepository
    participant OptionalPost
    participant Post

    Client->>PostService: findById(id)
    Note right of Client: Client calls PostService.findById with post ID

    PostService->>PostRepository: findById(id)
    Note right of PostService: Service delegates to PostRepository.findById

    PostRepository-->>OptionalPost: return OptionalPost
    Note right of PostRepository: Optional containing Post if found, empty otherwise

    PostService->>OptionalPost: orElseThrow(ObjectNotFoundException.new)
    Note right of PostService: Service calls orElseThrow on Optional

    alt Post is present in Optional
        OptionalPost-->>PostService: return Post object
        Note right of OptionalPost: Post object returned to service
        PostService-->>Client: return Post
        Note right of PostService: Post object returned to client
    else Post is absent in Optional
        OptionalPost->>PostService: throw ObjectNotFoundException
        Note right of OptionalPost: ObjectNotFoundException thrown when Optional is empty
        PostService->>Client: ObjectNotFoundException propagates
        Note right of PostService: Exception propagates to caller
    end
